	(text "CAN connectors: pin 1 = 24V NOT CONNECTED (AD-07), 2 = GND, 3 = CAN-H, 4 = CAN-L.\nTermination 120R: fit the jumper only at the end of the bus.\nTJA1051T/3: VCC 5 V, VIO 3.3 V, S to GND (normal mode)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 254 0)
